carbonenginejs/format-gltf
==========================

A pure-JavaScript format package for glTF 2.0 JSON and GLB mesh data. It
currently exposes a read path that emits the shared CarbonEngineJS JSON mesh
schema.

Contains no CarbonEngine or Fenris Creations (CCP Games) code. glTF itself is
not a CarbonEngine or CCP format; CarbonEngine and Fenris Creations (CCP Games)
are named here because this package's JSON output shape is designed for
CarbonEngineJS interoperability, including the GR2-facing mesh and animation
conventions that CarbonEngineJS has reverse-engineered from CarbonEngine
source-code structure and EVE Online assets.

No CarbonEngine or Fenris Creations (CCP Games) source files, tooling,
proprietary documentation, shaders, or assets are included in this repository.

The optional packed tangent conversion targets the CarbonEngineJS/GR2
tangent-frame convention. It is based on observed shader behavior and generated
test vectors, not copied shader source.

